# LF everywhere: lib/ must stay byte-identical to the upstream
# Digital-Multitool checkout (lib/VENDOR.md re-vendoring contract --
# a CRLF rewrite would make every re-vendor diff a full-file change),
# and the bench PC is Linux.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.py text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.txt text eol=lf
*.conf text eol=lf
*.png binary
